  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "That night I hid in the inn on Putney Hill, and lit no lamp for fear of them.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 5.86
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The house was stripped already. A rat had left me a crust and two pineapple tins.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 6.625,
      "seconds": 6.31
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Let the Heat-Ray have struck her painlessly out of being.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 13.458,
      "seconds": 3.81
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "At dawn I crept out like a rat from its hole, pockets full of biscuits.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 17.792,
      "seconds": 4.78
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The road was strewn with wreckage from the flight. I reached the common, lonelier than ever.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 23.083,
      "seconds": 5.86
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Frogs swarmed in a marsh, stubborn to live, and I stopped to learn from them.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 29.458,
      "seconds": 6.18
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then I felt watched. Something crouching in the bushes rose up, a man with a cutlass.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 36.167,
      "seconds": 6.52
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "artilleryman",
      "text": "Stop! Where do you come from?",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 43.208,
      "seconds": 2.18
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "artilleryman",
      "text": "They've built a flying-machine, and are learning to fly.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 45.917,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "artilleryman",
      "text": "Aren't you satisfied it is up with humanity? We're beat.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 50.125,
      "seconds": 3.92
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I hunted for an answer and found none. To them we were ants, and eatable.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 54.583,
      "seconds": 5.5
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I watched the beaten soldier's hand sweep across London, and something in me stirred.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 60.583,
      "seconds": 6.42
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Great God! But you are a man indeed!",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 67.542,
      "seconds": 3.06
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "His week of digging was a hole I could cut in a day. Still, I dug gladly.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 71.125,
      "seconds": 5.61
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "artilleryman",
      "text": "I am host today. Champagne! Let us take a rest.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 77.25,
      "seconds": 3.51
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "By lamplight I won three hard chess games from him, and learned his poker besides.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 81.292,
      "seconds": 6.06
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "So we played cards for London, parish by parish, and I found it delightful.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 87.875,
      "seconds": 5.84
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Late in the night he toasted my health. I took a cigar and climbed upstairs.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 94.25,
      "seconds": 5.42
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Under Mars and the violet weed-glow, I resolved to leave the dreamer and go on into London.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 100.208,
      "seconds": 5.5
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The day's folly burned in me. I had betrayed my wife and my kind.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 106.208,
      "seconds": 4.81
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "artilleryman",
      "text": "And man has come back to his own.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 115.708,
      "seconds": 2.31
    }
  ],
  "plan": "a174a7cef3f03a09"
}